🏥 Medical Insurance Charges Prediction API

A machine learning project that predicts medical insurance charges from customer demographic, lifestyle, and health-related information.

The project includes exploratory data analysis, feature preprocessing, regression model development, an XGBoost-based prediction model, a FastAPI backend, and Docker containerization.

🎯 Project Aim

The goal of this project is to build a machine learning system that can estimate medical insurance charges for an individual based on information such as:

Age

Sex

BMI

Number of children/dependents

Smoking status

Region

The project goes beyond training a model by packaging the trained model behind a FastAPI REST API and making the application available as a Docker image.

🚀 Project Highlights

Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)

Numerical and categorical feature analysis

One-Hot Encoding for categorical variables

Feature scaling with StandardScaler

Scikit-learn preprocessing pipeline

Regression model comparison

