⚠️ Limitations

The dataset contains 1,338 records and a limited number of predictive features.

Medical insurance charges can depend on many real-world factors that are not represented in this dataset.

Therefore:

Predictions should be treated as estimates.

Model performance depends on the available training data.

A high R² does not mean every individual prediction will be accurate.

Correlation does not imply causation.

The model should not be treated as a substitute for actual insurance pricing or professional financial/medical advice.

